# Never commit what a run of the tools leaves behind: banks (they hold text from memory files and
# conversations), bytecode, preview folders (they hold their own bank and exports), a default-named export,
# build output, and what file managers add. An export you name yourself is NOT ignored: tests/test_portability.py
# fails on any file that looks like one - run it before you commit.
.claude/
preview-home/
memorybank-preview-*/
memorybank-export-*.json
/dist/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.zip
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
